  contactDamage: 1
  description: The hat is wide because the bolt is honest. He carries violet fire
    the way a monk carries a prayer - constantly, and at you.
  tactics: Descends and periodically releases a full ring of bullets in every direction.
    The ring is dense near the Warlock and sparse far away - distance is armor. Kill
    it between rings, and never fight it point-blank.
